#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/include/05_fwupdate.js:57
msgid "A new firmware has been released: %s (%s, %s). This router runs %s."
msgstr "新固件已发布：%s（%s，%s）。本路由器运行的是 %s。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:58
msgid "A newer firmware is available: %s."
msgstr "有新版本固件：%s。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:60
msgid "A newer firmware is available: %s. You chose not to be reminded of it."
msgstr "有新版本固件：%s。你已选择不再提醒此版本。"

#: root/usr/share/luci/menu.d/zz-luci-app-fwupdate.json:3
msgid "Backup / Flash"
msgstr "备份与刷写"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:115
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:138
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:266
msgid "Check automatically"
msgstr "自动检查更新"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:207
msgid "Check error"
msgstr "检查出错"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:221
msgid "Check now"
msgstr "立即检查"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:267
msgid ""
"Check once a day. When this is off, the router only checks when you press "
"\"Check now\"."
msgstr "每天检查一次。关闭后，只在你点击“立即检查”时才检查。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:158
msgid "Checking the SHA-256…"
msgstr "正在校验 SHA-256…"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:173
msgid "Checking the image…"
msgstr "正在检查镜像…"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/include/05_fwupdate.js:69
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:234
msgid "Do not remind me of this version"
msgstr "不再提醒此版本"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:120
msgid "Download and install"
msgstr "下载并安装"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:228
msgid "Download and install…"
msgstr "下载并安装…"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:274
msgid "Download mirror"
msgstr "下载镜像"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:159
msgid "Downloaded %1024.2mB of %1024.2mB"
msgstr "已下载 %1024.2mB / %1024.2mB"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:129
msgid "Downloading firmware…"
msgstr "正在下载固件…"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/include/05_fwupdate.js:24
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:261
#: root/usr/share/luci/menu.d/luci-app-fwupdate.json:3
msgid "Firmware Update"
msgstr "固件更新"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:271
msgid "GitHub repository"
msgstr "GitHub 仓库"

#: root/usr/share/rpcd/acl.d/luci-app-fwupdate.json:3
msgid "Grant access to firmware updates"
msgstr "允许访问固件更新"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:279
msgid "HTTP proxy for the check and the download."
msgstr "检查和下载使用的 HTTP 代理。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:214
msgid "Image"
msgstr "镜像"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:111
msgid "Install firmware %s"
msgstr "安装固件 %s"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:172
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:183
msgid "Installing firmware…"
msgstr "正在安装固件…"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:113
msgid "Keep settings and retain the current configuration"
msgstr "保留当前配置"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:203
msgid "Last check"
msgstr "上次检查"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:210
msgid "Latest release"
msgstr "最新发布"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:68
msgid "No check has been made yet."
msgstr "还没有检查过。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:278
msgid "Proxy"
msgstr "代理"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:211
msgid "Published"
msgstr "发布时间"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:275
msgid ""
"Put in front of the image URL, for a GitHub mirror that is reachable from "
"here. The image is still checked against the SHA-256 that GitHub publishes."
msgstr "加在镜像下载地址前面，用于在这里能访问的 GitHub 加速镜像。下载的镜像仍会按 GitHub 公布的 SHA-256 校验。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/include/05_fwupdate.js:62
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:251
msgid "Release notes"
msgstr "更新说明"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:239
msgid "Remind me again"
msgstr "重新提醒"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:202
msgid "Running firmware"
msgstr "当前固件"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:264
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:126
msgid "Starting the download…"
msgstr "正在开始下载…"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:242
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:97
msgid "The check failed: %s"
msgstr "检查失败：%s"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:153
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:167
msgid "The download failed: %s"
msgstr "下载失败：%s"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:179
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:193
msgid "The firmware was not installed: %s"
msgstr "固件没有安装：%s"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:71
msgid ""
"The latest release has no image named after a revision, so it cannot be "
"compared with this firmware."
msgstr "最新发布里没有以版本号命名的镜像，无法与本固件比较。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:73
msgid ""
"The revision of this firmware is unknown, so it cannot be compared with the "
"latest release."
msgstr "本固件的版本号未知，无法与最新发布比较。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:112
msgid ""
"The router downloads %s (%1024.2mB) from GitHub, checks its SHA-256 against "
"the release and installs it into the other firmware slot. It then restarts "
"into the new firmware. Do not switch the router off while it does this."
msgstr "路由器会从 GitHub 下载 %s（%1024.2mB），按发布页的 SHA-256 校验后写入另一个固件槽位，然后重启进入新固件。期间请不要断电。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:262
msgid ""
"The router looks for a newer firmware among the releases on GitHub and "
"announces it on the overview page. Nothing is installed without your "
"confirmation."
msgstr "路由器在 GitHub 的发布中查找新固件，并在概览页提醒。未经你确认不会安装任何东西。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:66
msgid ""
"The router runs a different build of the same revision as the latest release."
msgstr "本路由器运行的固件与最新发布版本号相同，但不是同一次构建。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:64
msgid "The router runs a firmware newer than the latest release."
msgstr "本路由器运行的固件比最新发布更新。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:62
msgid "The router runs the latest firmware."
msgstr "本路由器运行的是最新固件。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:184
msgid ""
"The system is flashing now. DO NOT POWER OFF THE DEVICE! Wait a few minutes "
"before you try to reconnect. It might be necessary to renew the address of "
"your computer to reach the device again, depending on your settings."
msgstr "正在刷写固件。请勿断电！请等待几分钟后再尝试重新连接。根据你的设置，可能需要更新电脑的 IP 地址才能再次访问路由器。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/include/05_fwupdate.js:74
msgid "View and install"
msgstr "查看并安装"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:203
msgid "never"
msgstr "从未"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:153
#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/fwupdate.js:179
msgid "unknown error"
msgstr "未知错误"
